{
  "_note": "空态(还没设过计划)。\n\n两句话必须在这里说清,因为往后没有第二次机会:\n  ① 数据只在这台设备上 —— 这是这个包最重要的属性,也是它的**风险**(删包即永久丢失);\n  ② 可以回填 —— 新用户装上包时这盒药可能已经吃到第 13 天了,\n     若默认「今天是第 1 天」,人第一天就会放弃。所以起始日是可回填的,并且要在这里就说。",
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "card",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}-12pt",
        "bgColor": "#FFFFFF|#15171A",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "14pt",
          "leftB": "14pt",
          "rightT": "14pt",
          "rightB": "14pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "t",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "20pt",
        "y": "28pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-40pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.emptyTitle}",
        "fontSize": "18pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1"
      },
      {
        "id": "d",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "20pt",
        "y": "58pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-40pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.emptyDesc}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "3"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "20pt",
        "y": "132pt",
        "w": "130pt",
        "h": "40pt",
        "text": "${@i18n.emptyCta}",
        "fontSize": "14pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "alignmentH": "1",
        "alignmentV": "1",
        "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#0B0C0E",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "bgColor": "#128F66|#6FE8BE",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "20pt",
          "leftB": "20pt",
          "rightT": "20pt",
          "rightB": "20pt"
        },
        "events": {
          "onClick": "@[file://page/flow/open-setup.af]"
        }
      }
    ],
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "emptyTitle": "还没有记录计划",
        "emptyDesc": "设置起始日和周期就能开始逐日记录。起始日可以往前填 —— 这盒已经吃了几天也补得回来。所有记录只存在这台设备上。",
        "emptyCta": "开始设置"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "emptyTitle": "No schedule yet",
        "emptyDesc": "Set a start date and cycle to begin logging. The start date can be backdated, so a pack already in progress is fine. Everything stays on this device.",
        "emptyCta": "Set up"
      }
    }
  }
}
